    "long_instructions": "\r\n1. **Explore the Adoption Site (3 Minutes)**  \r\n\r\n   Navigate the pet adoption website as a typical user.\r\n   - Use more than one filter.  \r\n   - Open at least one “Details” section.  \r\n   - Click “Adopt” on a pet.  \r\n   - Visit another section (e.g., Cats, Contact).\r\n\r\n2. **Identify Usability Problems**  \r\n\r\n   In your activity guide, record **at least 3 specific usability problems** you encounter.\r\n   Consider areas such as:\r\n   - Navigation  \r\n   - Readability  \r\n   - Contrast  \r\n   - Clarity of buttons or labels  \r\n   - Feedback after clicking  \r\n   - Ease of finding information  \r\n\r\n   Be specific about what made the interaction harder than it needed to be.\r\n"
  },
  "audit_log": "[{\"changed_at\":\"2026-02-27 07:08:09 +0000\",\"changed\":[],\"changed_by_id\":19378,\"changed_by_email\":\"cody.diliberto@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-02-27 07:08:36 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"start_sources\"],\"changed_by_id\":19378,\"changed_by_email\":\"cody.diliberto@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-02-27 07:16:48 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"start_sources\"],\"changed_by_id\":19378,\"changed_by_email\":\"cody.diliberto@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-02-27 07:31:39 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"start_sources\"],\"changed_by_id\":19378,\"changed_by_email\":\"cody.diliberto@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-02-27 07:34:29 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"start_sources\"],\"changed_by_id\":19378,\"changed_by_email\":\"cody.diliberto@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-02-27 07:35:43 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"start_sources\"],\"changed_by_id\":19378,\"changed_by_email\":\"cody.diliberto@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-02-27 07:35:44 +0000\",\"changed\":[],\"changed_by_id\":19378,\"changed_by_email\":\"cody.diliberto@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-02-27 07:40:06 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"start_sources\"],\"changed_by_id\":19378,\"changed_by_email\":\"cody.diliberto@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-02-27 07:46:41 +0000\",\"changed\":[],\"changed_by_id\":19378,\"changed_by_email\":\"cody.diliberto@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-02-27 07:48:34 +0000\",\"changed\":[],\"changed_by_id\":19378,\"changed_by_email\":\"cody.diliberto@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-02-27 07:52:42 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"hide_share_and_remix\",\"widget_view\",\"initial_view_mode\",\"long_instructions\"],\"changed_by_id\":19378,\"changed_by_email\":\"cody.diliberto@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-02-27 07:53:20 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"initial_view_mode\"],\"changed_by_id\":19378,\"changed_by_email\":\"cody.diliberto@code.org\"}]"
